# Section intro design

Use for **all** page section intros (homepage, services, locations, CTAs, FAQ). See also `context.md`.

## Structure

```tsx
<header data-reveal className={styles.intro}>
  <SectionEyebrow className={styles.eyebrow}>{copy.eyebrow}</SectionEyebrow>
  <h2 className={styles.title}>{copy.title}</h2>
  <p className={styles.body}>{copy.body}</p>
</header>
```

- Eyebrow: always `SectionEyebrow` — never hand-rolled accent labels (locations included).
- Title / body: `--text-h2`/`--text-h1` + `--text-body`; full shell or card width.

## Width (required)

```css
.intro { max-width: none; width: 100%; }
.title { max-width: none; text-wrap: wrap; }
.body { max-width: none; }
```

Do not use `ch` / `40rem` caps on intro title or body. Stack eyebrow → title → body (no narrow side column for body).
